  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🎯 BigLead · 精准客户线索挖掘",
      "text": "按行业/产品/地区搜索目标公司，多渠道交叉验证，提取联系方式（如有），管理客户线索库。B2B 销售、市场调研、竞品分析。\n\n> English: B2B lead generation: search target companies, cross-validate, extract contacts, manage pipeline."
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 功能",
      "text": "详见 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 完整说明。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔧 环境依赖",
      "text": "Python 3 + 联网搜索能力（web search 工具）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "📥 安装（DeepSeek Harness / dsh）",
      "text": "本技能遵循 **Agent Skills 开放标准**（SKILL.md + YAML frontmatter），适用于 DeepSeek Harness (dsh)、OpenClaw、Claude Code 等支持 Agent Skills 的框架。\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：放入用户级共享目录（推荐）",
      "text": "mkdir -p ~/.agents\ngit clone https://github.com/kobenfang/biglead.git ~/.agents/biglead"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：放入项目目录",
      "text": "mkdir -p .agents\ncp -r biglead .agents/\n```\n\ndsh 启动后即可在技能列表中找到 `biglead`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔍 搜索关键词",
      "text": "客户线索, 销售, B2B, 获客, 市场调研, lead generation, sales prospecting"
    },
    {
      "section": "📄 目录结构",
      "text": "```\nbiglead/\n├── SKILL.md          # 技能定义（Agent Skills 标准）\n├── scripts/biglead.py\n```"
